-- Maraudon (map 349): mobs stood still (Four, 2026-10-24: "much more creatures wandered or had paths").
--
-- The BFA world database has no waypoint paths and no wandering for any Maraudon mob except a few
-- critters. Two references were used, matched to these spawns by creature entry and position:
-- * the Pandaria 5.4.8 database (same spawn guids): 30 waypoint paths;
-- * the AzerothCore 3.3.5 database (classic layout): 8 more paths (Princess Theradras, Meshlok,
--   Spirit of Veng, a Sister of Celebras pair, a Celebrian Dryad pair, a Stolid Snapjaw, a
--   Thessala Hydra, a Corruptor group), their formations, and random wandering (218 spawns).
-- Wander radius is capped at 5 yards (this core's random movement doesn't path around walls), and
-- water creatures (Thessala Hydra, Stolid Snapjaw, Rotgrip) don't wander.
-- Path ids 349000001+ are new.

DELETE FROM `waypoint_data` WHERE `id` BETWEEN 349000001 AND 349000999;
